'''Copycat''' (Japanese: '''モノマネむすめ''' ''Mimic Girl'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Shuffle your hand into your deck. Draw a card for each card in your opponent's hand.
}}

