==Trivia==
* This card's effect is the same as that of {{TCG|Copycat}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

===Origin===
* {{OBP|Copycat|character}} is a NPC in {{game|Red and Blue|s|Pokémon Red, Blue}}, {{v2|Yellow}}, {{game3|Gold and Silver|Gold, Silver|s}}, {{v2|Crystal}}, {{game3|FireRed and LeafGreen|FireRed, LeafGreen|s}}, {{game3|HeartGold and SoulSilver|HeartGold, SoulSilver|s}}, and {{LGPE|Let's Go, Pikachu!, Let's Go, Eevee!}}.
** This card depicts Copycat dressed as {{ga|Ethan}}, [[Fantina]], [[Hala]], and [[Lisia]].

